    "comment": "Kapampangan (pam-pam) = 3 (Wider communication). Statutory language of provincial identity in Pampanga and 2 other Luzon provinces (1991, ACFLC Section 3(f)). Became widespread in the 18th century during Spanish colonial rule. Used in commerce, entrepreneurship, religion, trade, and handicrafts."
